    "**What happened?**\n\n\n**What did you expect to happen?**\n\n\n---\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Was ist passiert?**\n\n\n**Was hattest du erwartet?**\n\n\n---\n"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**What happened?**\n\n\n**What did you expect to happen?**\n\n\n---\n"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**¿Qué ha ocurrido?**\n\n\n**¿Qué esperabas que ocurriera?**\n\n\n---\n"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Que s’est-il passé ?**\n\n\n**Quel résultat attendiez-vous ?**\n\n\n---\n"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**何が起きましたか？**\n\n\n**どのような動作を期待していましたか？**\n\n\n---\n"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**O que aconteceu?**\n\n\n**O que você esperava que acontecesse?**\n\n\n---\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**What would make Hero Dirt better for you?**\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
